  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIIAtr">III Atr</ref> 2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">And þæt þæt man cyðe mid gewitnesse, þæt nan man þæt ne awende æt cwícon þe ma þe æt déadon.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Secondly, declarations made with the support of witnesses shall be incontrovertible, whether the persons concerned be alive or dead.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Et hoc quod per legitimum testimonium monstrabitur, nemo peruertat de uiuo plus quam de mortuo.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
